OL,3,CCoventry City promotion parade as Sky
OL,4,CBlues party ahead of Premier League
OL,5,Creturn
OL,7,FThousands of Coventry City fans are
OL,8,Flining the streets of the city today,
OL,9,Fas the club celebrates a long-awaited
OL,10,Freturn to the Premier League with a
OL,11,Fbus parade and music festival.
OL,13,FAn open-top bus parade began at the
OL,14,FCoventry Building Society Arena at 1pm.
OL,16,FThe route started earlier today at
OL,17,FHolbrooks and went through Keresley
OL,18,Fbefore ending at Hearsall Common.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/7
