OL,3,CCoventry City promotion parade as Sky
OL,4,CBlues party ahead of Premier League
OL,5,Creturn
OL,7,FPlayers and staff then travelled to
OL,8,Fthe War Memorial Park, where they took
OL,9,Fto the stage at 4pm.
OL,11,FWatch the route the bus parade took
OL,12,Facross the city.
OL,14,FA one-day music festival in War
OL,15,FMemorial Park will welcome around
OL,16,F50,000 fans from 4pm, as the party
OL,17,Fcontinues into the evening.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/7
