OL,3,CCoventry City promotion parade as Sky
OL,4,CBlues party ahead of Premier League
OL,5,Creturn
OL,7,FThere will also be free on-street
OL,8,Fparking in designated bays in the city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,F"You've got to celebrate"
OL,13,FClub owner Doug King spoke to ITV News
OL,14,FCentral about the importance of
OL,15,Fcelebrating now with the fans, while
OL,16,Flooking back on previous celebrations,
OL,17,Fciting the importance of safety at
OL,18,Fthese events.
OL,20,FManager Frank Lampard recently won
OL,21,FChampionship Manager of the Season.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/7
